      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This standstill calculator is only suitable for use in procurements regulated by the Procurement Act 2023.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement Act 2023 Standstill Calculator",
        "Standstill calculator"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Every effort has been made to ensure that results provided by the standstill period calculator accurately reflect the position under the Act.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement Act 2023 Standstill Calculator",
        "Standstill calculator"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "By using the standstill period calculator, you accept and agree that such use (and any use made of the results) is subject to our terms and conditions , which include a disclaimer and exclusion of liability.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement Act 2023 Standstill Calculator",
        "Standstill calculator"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Note that any failure to implement the correct length of standstill period may have serious legal consequences for a contracting authority. If you are at all unsure, we recommend that you seek specific legal advice.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement Act 2023 Standstill Calculator",
        "Standstill calculator"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "2024 Mills & Reeve",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement Act 2023 Standstill Calculator",
        "Standstill calculator"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The key change to the standstill period under the Procurement Act 2023 is that the period is now eight working days beginning with the publication date of the notice that commences the standstill period. This will usually be a Contract Award Notice, but could be a Contract Change Notice (see our Notices Generator to learn more).",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Procurement Act 2023 Standstill Calculator",
        "Standstill calculator"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
